# No Duplicate Tests
RULE: Never create test_*_extended.py, test_*_additional.py, test_*_v2.py. Expand existing test files.
WHY: Duplicate files fragment coverage and increase maintenance.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/testing.md, .cursor/rules/test-quality-standards.mdc
DO: Add new test methods to existing test_config.py; create new file only for uncovered module
NEVER: test_config_extended.py; test_adapter_2.py; split by "concern" artificially
